nd your mercenaries to annihilate your foes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656680/extras/c6a0fe6bbca53d29f3b52f139e55f8b9.poster.avif?t=1757264415\" width=576 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656680/extras/c6a0fe6bbca53d29f3b52f139e55f8b9.webm?t=1757264415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656680/extras/c6a0fe6bbca53d29f3b52f139e55f8b9.mp4?t=1757264415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can order your mercenaries whom to attack and where to move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under your command, your mercenaries will wipe out the enemy forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4. Combine cards, relics, and mercenaries to create the ultimate synergy.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656680/extras/e26a603c2159c91f1535107edcbb0324.poster.avif?t=1757264415\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656680/extras/e26a603c2159c91f1535107edcbb0324.webm?t=1757264415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656680/extras/e26a603c2159c91f1535107edcbb0324.mp4?t=1757264415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surviving the battle alone is not enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your remaining gold wisely to earn more interest, and strengthen your deck and team even further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stronger your combinations of cards, relics, and mercenaries, the smoother your future expeditions will become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>5. Escape the dungeon and bring your recruited mercenaries with you!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656680/extras/b9d5aa14bfd12dafb0b5e04a8c3cfb3d.poster.avif?t=1757264415\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656680/extras/b9d5aa14bfd12dafb0b5e04a8c3cfb3d.webm?t=1757264415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656680/extras/b9d5aa14bfd12dafb0b5e04a8c3cfb3d.mp4?t=1757264415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You no longer need to Slay the Dungeon — Escape the Dungeon instead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Preserve the mercenaries you’ve recruited, along with the cards and relics you’ve collected, and expand your resources even further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This will help you prepare more thoroughly for your next dungeon run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, anything lost inside the dungeon cannot be recovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the right moment to escape carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>6. Don’t linger too long in the dungeon.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656680/extras/27020896b8cf2363bc390a0fb974562c.poster.avif?t=1757264415\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656680/extras/27020896b8cf2363bc390a0fb974562c.webm?t=1757264415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656680/extras/27020896b8cf2363bc390a0fb974562c.mp4?t=1757264415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don’t test the dungeon’s patience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you stay, the higher the danger level grows—and the stronger the monsters you’ll face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path carefully to avoid raising the danger level too much.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And escape before it’s too late!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
